 "fields": [
  {
   "fieldname": "intro",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<p>Connect this Frappe HR site to Ajab, the AI interview platform. HR can then send job openings to Ajab, schedule AI interviews for applicants, get the scores back on the Job Applicant, and sync employees as Ajab team members.</p><p>An Ajab organisation admin creates the API key in Ajab under <b>Settings → API Keys</b>. Use the <b>Full access</b> preset, or at least the ATS integration scopes plus <code>webhooks:manage</code> and <code>members:sync</code>.</p>"
  },
  {
